tests/cases/m52/tp0305_coalesce.tpn:3:18: warning TP0305: '??' binds more loosely than '+', so this is 'd.get("a") ?? (0 + 1)'
  help: write '(d.get("a") ?? 0) + 1' if you meant that, or add the parentheses to keep this
tests/cases/m52/tp0305_coalesce.tpn:4:18: warning TP0305: '??' binds more loosely than '-', so this is 'd.get("z") ?? (2 * 3 - 1)'
  help: write '(d.get("z") ?? 2) * 3 - 1' if you meant that, or add the parentheses to keep this
tests/cases/m52/tp0305_coalesce.tpn:5:12: warning TP0305: '??' binds more loosely than '+', so this is 'name ?? ("anon" + "!")'
  help: write '(name ?? "anon") + "!"' if you meant that, or add the parentheses to keep this
