  help: write '(d.get("y") ?? 4) + 5' if you meant that, or add the parentheses to keep this
tests/cases/m52/tp0305_coalesce.tpn:10:18: warning TP0305: '??' binds more loosely than '*', so this is 'd.get("a") ?? ((2) * 3)'
